@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Rebuild the VM (Invoke-LazyVMRebuild)

actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Task Scheduler\n(SYSTEM)" as Sched

rectangle "Massokissed.LazyVM" {
  usecase "Rebuild the VM\n<size:10>Invoke-LazyVMRebuild</size>" as Rebuild
  usecase "Capture state" as Capture
  usecase "Retire the old VM" as Retire
  usecase "Create the VM and install\nWindows unattended" as CreateVM
  usecase "Install the tooling list" as Tooling
  usecase "Extend C: to the whole disk" as ExpandC
  usecase "Configure the guest" as Configure
  usecase "Restore state" as Restore
  usecase "Verify the rebuilt VM" as Verify
  usecase "Delete the retired disk" as DelRetired
}

actor "Hyper-V" as HV <<system>>
actor "Guest Windows" as Guest <<system>>

Admin --> Rebuild
Sched --> Rebuild

Capture ..> Rebuild : <<extend>>\n[not -SkipCapture]
Rebuild ..> Retire : <<include>>
Rebuild ..> CreateVM : <<include>>
Rebuild ..> Tooling : <<include>>
Rebuild ..> Configure : <<include>>
Rebuild ..> Restore : <<include>>
Rebuild ..> Verify : <<include>>
Tooling ..> ExpandC : <<include>>
DelRetired ..> Verify : <<extend>>\n[passed and\nDeleteRetiredDiskOnSuccess]

Retire --> HV
CreateVM --> HV
Verify --> HV
Capture --> Guest
Tooling --> Guest
Configure --> Guest
Restore --> Guest
@enduml
